          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ತಲೆಸುತ್ತು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತಲೆಸುತ್ತು (talesuttu) — \"dizziness\", literally \"head-spinning\": ತಲೆ (tale), \"head\", with ಸುತ್ತು (suttu), \"to go round\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನನಗೆ ತಲೆಸುತ್ತು (nanage talesuttu) — \"I feel dizzy\", built like ನನಗೆ ತಲೆನೋವು."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Head, and a turn, make one more head word."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
